## Interface: 16001
## Title: CharacterUIBaseline
## Notes: Synchronizes the configured source UI on each login, moves characters off Blizzard's preset Edit Mode layouts to 'rex' and skips setup, guide and what's-new windows at login. /uib apply retries; /uib capture publishes on the source.
## Author: Rex Sun
## Version: 0.4.2
## DefaultState: Enabled
## OptionalDeps: YUI, EllesmereUI, EllesmereUIRaidFrames, Details, GearInsight_Forever, GatherLite, MapUtils, Bagnon, OverlapSettingsGuard
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: CharacterUIBaselineDB
## SavedVariables: CharacterUIBaselineAccountDB

Baseline.lua
Source.local.lua
EditModeLayout.lua
QuietLogin.lua
Bootstrap.lua
